  "steps": [
    {
      "zh": "巧克力海绵主配方：165°C（329°F）烤 30 分钟。",
      "en": "Main chocolate sponge: Bake at 165°C (329°F) for 30 minutes."
    },
    {
      "zh": "巧克力烤芝士层：150°C（302°F）烤 25–28 分钟；出炉时中心保持轻微晃动即可。",
      "en": "Baked chocolate cheesecake layer: Bake at 150°C (302°F) for 25–28 minutes; the center should still wobble slightly when removed from the oven."
    },
    {
      "zh": "马斯卡彭慕斯选项：冷藏 4 小时以上，建议过夜后脱模。",
      "en": "Mascarpone mousse option: Chill for at least 4 hours; overnight chilling is recommended before unmolding."
    },
    {
      "zh": "草莓慕斯选项：冷藏 4 小时以上，最好隔夜。",
      "en": "Strawberry mousse option: Chill for at least 4 hours, preferably overnight."
    },
    {
      "zh": "三层暂整理为巧克力海绵底、巧克力烤芝士层，以及二选一的马斯卡彭慕斯或草莓慕斯。脱模前建议确认各层已充分定型。",
      "en": "The three layers are provisionally organized as a chocolate sponge base, baked chocolate cheesecake layer, and either mascarpone mousse or strawberry mousse. Make sure each layer is fully set before unmolding."
    }
  ],
